1
00:00:00,423 --> 00:00:03,093
No, no. You're right.
Someone needs to come talk to him.

2
00:00:03,259 --> 00:00:06,679
(Leonard:)Don't worry, I'll take care of it. Yeah.
All right.

3
00:00:08,222 --> 00:00:09,262
(Leonard:)New plan.

4
00:00:09,432 --> 00:00:13,392
(Leonard:)Howard, you and Raj go to Texas,
I'll stay with Penny in her apartment.

5
00:00:13,853 --> 00:00:16,313
(Penny:)-You're not gonna go with them?
-Well, you know...

6
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:19,270
(Leonard:)...I gave you the snowflake,
and we were kissing, and--

7
00:00:19,442 --> 00:00:21,522
Come on. I don't wanna go to Texas.

8
00:00:22,612 --> 00:00:27,072
(Howard:)Oh, right. And I do? My people already
crossed the desert once. We're done.

9
00:00:30,328 --> 00:00:31,998
Trust me, you'll be fine. See you.

10
00:00:32,496 --> 00:00:35,286
(Penny:)Well, wait a second, Leonard.
Come on. How can you not go?

11
00:00:35,458 --> 00:00:37,958
(Penny:)-He's your best friend.
-But I already saw him naked.

12
00:00:38,127 --> 00:00:39,877
(Leonard:)-Just come here.
PENNY: No.

13
00:00:40,087 --> 00:00:42,257
(Penny:)I promise I will be here
when you get back.

14
00:00:42,423 --> 00:00:44,053
(Penny:)Just go help Sheldon.

15
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,050
(Sheldon:)-Really?
-Yeah.

16
00:00:46,218 --> 00:00:49,598
(Penny:)We waited a few months.
We can wait a few more days.

17
00:00:53,643 --> 00:00:55,393
(Leonard:)Maybe you can.

18
00:00:57,355 --> 00:01:00,025
(Scene:)Go.

